	"Name": "Custom Farm Types",
	"Author": "spacechase0",
	"TagLine": "Allow adding custom farm types.",
	"Description": "This mod allows adding custom farm types without conflicts or overwriting base game files.\n\nFarm types can customize their behavior to act like one of the vanilla presets in their type.json. If desired, they can also act differently.\n\nTo add a new farm type, add a corresponding subfolder in the 'FarmTypes' folder. Each farm type needs an type.json, map.xnb and icon.png.\n\nThere are examples of matching vanilla behavior, and \"full\" customization included. Feel free to remove them if you want.\n\n(NOTE: If you remove the mod, farms will revert back to the 'Standard' farm map until you reinstall the mod. The same applies if you remove an active farm type.)\n\nRequires SpaceCore.",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.moddrop.com/stardew-valley/mods/128708",
